# MySQL 8 verification trigger

Touching this file (one line change) makes the `MySQL 8 report` workflow run:
it migrates and tests the suite against a real MySQL 8 server, mirrors the
quality and assets command groups from ci.yml, and commits the transcripts to
`docs/ci/mysql-8-report.md` on this branch.

The report is committed rather than only stored in the Actions UI so that the
result can be read with `git fetch` from an environment where the GitHub API is
not reachable.

